            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ĩndĩ o tondũ ũsilĩlo ũtw’ĩtwe wookie ĩũlũ wa andũ onthe kwondũ wa ĩvĩtyo yĩmwe; o ta ũu kwondũ wa wĩko ũmwe wa ũlũngalu ũla mũthĩnzĩo wookie kwa andũ onthe, waete kũtalĩlwa ũlũngalu wa thayũ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
